WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.086 --> 00:00:04.630
Mr. President, the
British are suffering from

00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:06.215
increasingly more
dangerous cyberattacks.

00:00:09.426 --> 00:00:10.761
The Thames barrier has failed,

00:00:12.304 --> 00:00:15.349
causing the worst floods in the
capital for over a century.

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:20.020
The operators think someone
got into the system.

00:00:21.396 --> 00:00:22.397
We've been tracking the suspect.

00:00:23.815 --> 00:00:25.192
We think it's connected
to a terrorist plot.

00:00:26.818 --> 00:00:29.488
Facial recognition identifies
him as Gabriel Delage.

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:33.325
I should be calling
the cops right now.

00:00:33.325 --> 00:00:35.827
Mm-hmm, you should.

00:00:37.246 --> 00:00:39.456
I've been seeing someone
for the past five years,

00:00:39.456 --> 00:00:41.083
and we're going
to get married.

00:00:41.083 --> 00:00:42.084
Does he know about everything?

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:45.754
No.

00:00:48.257 --> 00:00:49.299
This holds the attack plans.

00:00:49.675 --> 00:00:50.842
The attack already took place.

00:00:51.969 --> 00:00:52.970
No, that was a warning.

00:00:53.804 --> 00:00:54.513
Until somebody
claims responsibility,

00:00:54.513 --> 00:00:55.514
the job isn't over.

00:00:56.348 --> 00:00:57.516
And you trust this man?

00:00:58.267 --> 00:00:59.685
After what you did to him?

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:03.063
I guess you must
hate me to death.

00:01:03.689 --> 00:01:05.065
I'm trying to tell you
that I've changed.

00:01:06.275 --> 00:01:07.776
You think people change?

00:01:10.487 --> 00:01:11.697
It's happening again.

00:01:14.116 --> 00:01:15.534
The complete control
of the grid.

00:01:16.827 --> 00:01:18.787
We have to get a grip
of this, Alison.

00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:20.872
I need you.

00:01:21.832 --> 00:01:23.542
I know those guys
more than you do.

00:01:25.836 --> 00:01:26.878
They're going to slaughter us.

00:01:30.507 --> 00:01:31.842
If you stay here,
you'll die.

00:01:33.802 --> 00:01:34.803
I know that they're
preparing an attack,

00:01:34.803 --> 00:01:35.846
and I'm supposed
to run away?

00:01:37.306 --> 00:01:38.515
Who do you take me for?

